[
    {
        "content": "<p>When doing some prototyping for <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113488\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Persistent.20interactive.20data.3F/with/603993019\">#general &gt; Persistent interactive data?</a>, I was having difficulty testing my elaborator which modified an environment extension. Eventually I realized that when using <code>#eval</code> or <code>#check</code> or <code>example</code>, the environment is rolled back so the elaborators have no effect, while when using elaborators in <code>def</code> statements, the changes to the environment persist. Does anyone know why this is?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#mycommand\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addDecl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">axiomDecl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`mynat1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">levelParams</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[],</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``Nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isUnsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"myterm\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">addDecl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">axiomDecl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`mynat2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">levelParams</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[],</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``Nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isUnsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkNatLit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">mycommand</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mynat1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Works</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myterm</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mynat2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Unknown identifier `mynat2`</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myterm</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mynat2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Works</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 604003065,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1781670069
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Well, this is true of most <code>#</code>-commands. For example, you'll see that <code>#check myterm</code>, <code>#reduce myterm</code>, <code>#check myterm</code> have similar behavior. That's because these commands are primarily for introspection and not for producing effects (but there are exceptions, e.g. confusingly, <code>#guard myterm = 0</code> <em>does</em> create <code>mynat2</code>). <code>#eval</code> is also kinda an exception but it only allow environment changes while evaluating the term (after compilation).</p>",
        "id": 604029727,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1781677741
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Or, another way to think about it, <code>#</code>-commands should usually be removable without changing the behavior of the remainder of the file.</p>",
        "id": 604029988,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1781677812
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>There are commands like <code>run_cmd</code> and <code>run_meta</code> that should be helpful here.</p>",
        "id": 605889374,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1782175552
    }
]